        IF `the Registrar of the Supreme Court gave notice of the transfer to every party to the case` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Rule says the Registrar "must give notice" and does not say what follows if not

@ref O 23 r 6(3)(c) (src:3598-3599)
