    IF `the ground is that any of the terms of the suspension has been breached`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "on the ground that any of the terms of the suspension has been breached"

-- src:3667 | (4) An application under paragraph (3) must be made by summons supported by an affidavit and must be served on the committal respondent.
